    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σᾰμάρεια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], ἡ</span>, <u>Samaria</u>, a city
